WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.990
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:05.730
<i>We look the same, but men call us monsters.</i>

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.040
<i>If we shadows, which lurk between eras,</i>

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.490
<i>are destined to die,</i>

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.280
<i>then I shall fall with the cherry blossoms.</i>

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:17.450
<i>Then, I shall fall with the cherry blossoms.</i>

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:55.100
I don't know.

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:59.440
I don't know, but perhaps 
it's a different "now"

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:04.240
than the "now" where we fought the 
Joujinshuu and lost our companions.

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:07.720
No matter what world this is,

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:13.080
we can't let Joujin destroy it!

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:55.020
<b><i>The Cherry Blossoms Bloom</i></b>

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.150
You would interfere?

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.660
I did not expect to see such entertainment.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:09.410
I don't know who you are, but you are fools.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:13.170
We'll start with the most troublesome one.

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:35.440
Impossible...

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:38.570
Damn you!

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.130
Feel my Destiny's Passage!

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:47.350
What?

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.410
Damn you...

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:05.340
You feinted, using me!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.620
Neirichiou!

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:06.530
Who are you?

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.390
Kouga Hachirou.

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:09.660
Iga Hibiki.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:17.420
Still, they were worthless.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.670
They died so easily.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.220
What's wrong?

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:27.680
You won't use that eye magic on me?

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.030
Hachirou...

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:30.000
Wait.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.750
My Spearing Eye won't work on him.

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:33.930
In that case, I'll...

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.110
No, we should assume

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:38.810
we were lucky just now and 
caught them off guard.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:41.660
Joujin.

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:43.320
No matter what world you're in,

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:46.820
your wicked desires will 
never come to fruition!

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:50.320
No matter what world I'm in?

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:55.080
Then what happened to 
me in this "other world"?

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.460
You died.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:00.830
I died... And then what happened?

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:05.340
And your plans failed. That's all.

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:08.590
So that is all you know?

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:09.590
What?

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.020
I see...

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:14.000
What's so funny?!

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:17.730
Enough! Begone!

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:24.060
No matter the fate that binds 
us in another world,

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:26.550
we are strangers here.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:31.570
I shall use the Murakumo 
to realize my ambitions!

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:32.740
I see.

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:38.330
But, Joujin, you still know nothing 
of our final technique!

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.580
What?

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:55.100
What is this?

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:08.490
I'll handle the rest.

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:10.240
Okay.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:14.240
So, what do you think?

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:17.810
Caring.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.240
Love.

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:20.360
Pain.

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:21.430
Sorrow.

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:24.250
All those feelings combined...

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:29.630
The contradictory powers 
you originally possessed

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:35.010
turned those feelings into 
an incredible strength.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:38.020
If... If that's true,

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:41.270
then why can't we control it ourselves?

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:46.680
Those emotions are so violent and 
passionate, none can control them.

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:51.650
That's why joy, sadness, and madness.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:54.480
What I don't understand

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:59.590
is why the technique that you created 
cannot bring you happiness.

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.170
It's so unfair...

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:10.670
Ouka has another form.

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:12.040
Yes.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:18.180
Or, perhaps, one that you 
could call its true form.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.590
Its true form.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:24.640
Is this... your technique?

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:45.830
Behold.

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:49.590
All this is your doing!

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.990
In the end, my own weakness,

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:03.600
which forced me to use Ouka 
to defeat you, pains me!

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:07.100
You would... kill me?

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.980
I will show you no mercy.

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:13.110
Die, Joujin.

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:49.410
It doesn't matter what Ouka is.

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:53.400
We must give it up.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.290
Yes.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:57.980
But as long as we're together,

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:01.410
we cannot escape it.

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:05.660
So I have decided what I will give up.

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.670
You would leave me again?

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:23.680
No!

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:26.670
Give me another chance, Hachirou!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.070
The Shielding Eye...

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:42.040
That's right.

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:45.330
This is what I always should have done.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.450
Hibiki!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.450
No...

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:15.610
Now, you'll never forget Ouka.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.760
Or leave me...

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.160
Hibiki...

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:26.620
I'll never leave you again.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:30.600
I'll spend eternity with you.

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:35.320
Fools...

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:41.720
Joujin!

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:47.140
Is that your answer?

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:51.710
You... died back there!

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:08.740
No way.

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:10.410
Tenzen?

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.670
It seems you know him.

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:22.310
The Tenzen cherry tree that blooms 
above Jison'in Village...

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:26.480
An immortal ninja gave the 
tree its name. Tenzen.

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:28.980
He was real?

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.430
So it seems.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:36.540
Now, he lives within me.

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:44.450
I never thought she'd destroy 
her own eyes, though.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.470
How dull.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:51.290
In that case, forget about us!

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:53.210
I will.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:57.210
But if I let you live, you'll get in my way.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.370
What?

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:08.860
Even a pebble, alongside the road, 
can cause one to stumble.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:11.470
You must be removed!

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:25.890
The technique you used to defeat Magoroku...

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:29.540
It seems to reflect an 
enemy's desire to kill.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:33.500
An interesting technique.

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:41.530
But you will not use it on me now?

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:46.740
I assume we met in some other world,

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:48.800
and it failed to affect me.

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:54.270
And I have seen your weakness, too.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:57.330
Hachirou!

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:02.870
Hibiki...

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:05.780
Hachirou, where are you?

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.280
Too easy.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.970
Stupid child.

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:46.100
Joujin, aren't you embarrassed?

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:52.950
To survive using the power of Tenzen...

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.160
Of a mere ninja?

00:14:55.460 --> 00:15:00.010
You plan to anger me, to draw 
out my desire to kill you?

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:02.190
You make me laugh.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:07.690
Tenzen fell in love with Iga Oboro, 
the leader of her clan,

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:10.810
and even tried to rape her.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.050
A true monster.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:21.690
If you use the power of a worthless ninja 
like that to fulfill your ambitions...

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:25.530
Can you honestly be proud of them?

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:29.460
You give up less easily than expected.

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:32.000
I told you, it won't work.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.360
Wh-What?

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:59.220
You used... Tenzen's desire... to kill you?

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:11.240
Tenzen, stop it... Tenzen!

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:14.770
Hachirou! Where are you?

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:22.650
Impossible...

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:12.020
Stop... Chou!

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:16.510
<b>Edo Castle</b>

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:20.510
I don't like Tadanaga.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:22.840
I don't believe him, either.

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:27.380
He tried to plot rebellion.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.240
The fool.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.150
But...

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:39.160
Who put him up to it?

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:45.260
Our destinies were decided 
by a battle between ninjas.

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:51.420
He and I were the only ones who 
knew that pathetic fact.

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:55.830
He still hates me...

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:02.860
It was all for the glory of the Tokugawa Clan!

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:09.020
<i>Some say Tenkai lived for another 
decade, reaching over a century,</i>

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:12.570
<i>until he had fulfilled
all his earthly desires.</i>

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:22.700
W-Wait!

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:25.360
I...

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:30.710
<i>The tenth year of the Kan'ei Era.</i>

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:36.480
<i>December. Tokugawa Tadanaga commits 
seppuku at the Shogun's order.</i>

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:45.160
<i>Few people knew that the true 
Tadanaga had already died.</i>

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:53.290
<i>And the cherry blossoms bloomed 
and fell several times...</i>

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:00.140
Get 'em, Shichigen!

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:02.010
Just you wait, Utsutsu...

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:03.510
I won't lose today!

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:05.870
Rui! Come see!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.340
Come and get me.

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:10.560
They're at it again...

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:13.700
Is Hachisu really a girl?

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:14.550
Let's go.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.130
Shikibu, wait!

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.940
Saizou, what was that for?!

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:20.880
I'm helping.

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:23.170
I don't need your help.

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:25.030
I'm a samurai!

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:27.340
Then I'm on Hachisu's side.

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:29.860
Everyone, food's ready!

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:30.890
Come on back!

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:32.680
Yay! Food!

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:36.490
Hibiki-san, we'll come to get you soon!

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:38.780
Okay!

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:42.430
I'm going to stand here and 
enjoy the wind a bit longer.

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.410
I see...

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:52.420
You cannot see, and Hachirou isn't here?

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:53.870
Joujin!

00:19:56.850 --> 00:20:00.000
But on that day... Joujin...

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:02.710
Died?

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:06.650
It's true that I died, once.

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:07.680
But...

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:09.680
Tenzen.

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:12.690
I'd expect no less from the Iga leader.

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:17.850
Nobunaga-sama has returned to hell,

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.800
and Hachirou is gone.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:23.710
And you have destroyed your own eyes,

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:25.810
so you can no longer use Ouka.

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:30.200
But there is one last thing you can do.

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:32.930
That's right...

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:36.110
I shall fill you with the seed of life.

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:39.710
And you will bear our child.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.890
No one will come to save you.

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:45.970
Give up and become mine!

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:53.020
Your blood...

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:57.150
If your blood and mine combine,

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:01.240
perhaps we can create a 
technique to surpass Ouka.

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:07.800
With your blood and mine, we shall 
make this world a living hell.

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:37.950
Hachirou...

00:22:00.490 --> 00:22:05.130
It's so bright and windy today...
